hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"399","Abu Ayyub"
"400","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"401","Anas reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"402","Hisham ibn 'Amir al-Ansari"
"403","'A'isha mentioned that the Messenger of Allah"
"404","Abu Khirash al-Aslami reported that he heard the Messenger of Allah"
"405","'Imran ibn Abi Anas reported from a man of Aslam who was one of\nthe Companions of the Prophet"
"406","Abu Ayyub al-Ansari reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"407","Hisham ibn 'Amir heard the Messenger of Allah"
"408","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"409","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"410","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"411","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"412","Abu'd-Darda' said"
"413","the one who dies and has not associated anything\nwith Allah"
"414","Abu Hurayra reported that he heard the Prophet"
"415","Salim ibn 'Abdullah reported from his father that 'Umar used to\nsay to his sons"
"416","Ibn 'Umar saw a shepherd with some sheep in a bad place and saw\na place which was better than it. He told him"
